d2 ( body nm ) ndio area=mf * ((wr - dw / factor) * lr / 5.0) pj=mf * 2.0 * lr / 
+ 5.0
d3 ( body nn ) ndio area=mf * ((wr - dw / factor) * lr / 5.0) pj=mf * 2.0 * lr / 
